WHO   — WE — a NOUTHESIA book-world
WHAT  — Yevgeny Zamyatin · 1924 · the glass city, the dissolved ‘I’
WHERE — We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Framework inputs: We (Yevgeny Zamyatin, 1924)  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — They will offer you a perfect, painless happiness — and the only price is the ‘I’ that could ever have enjoyed it; keep the soul they call a disease.
HOW   — In the glass-walled One State, every ‘number’ lives in transparent uniformity under the all-seeing Benefactor and the Table of Hours. D-503, the mathematician building the Integral to carry the One State's perfection to other worlds, begins a forbidden journal and meets I-330, who draws him into the rebellion of the Mephi beyond the Green Wall. He develops a ‘soul’ — diagnosed as a disease — and the State's answer is the Great Operation: the surgical excision of imagination from every citizen.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
